 "captions": [
  {
   "text": "Grandpa, I typed \"hello\"",
   "s": 0,
   "e": 1.14,
   "line": 1,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "to my teacher.",
   "s": 1.2,
   "e": 2.11,
   "line": 1,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "My phone sent \"jello.\"",
   "s": 2.2,
   "e": 3.5,
   "line": 1,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Your thumb landed between two keys.",
   "s": 3.56,
   "e": 5.54,
   "line": 2,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "H and J are neighbors.",
   "s": 5.6,
   "e": 7.16,
   "line": 2,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "So it just picked one?",
   "s": 7.22,
   "e": 8.36,
   "line": 3,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "It guessed.",
   "s": 8.42,
   "e": 9.15,
   "line": 4,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "It always guesses.",
   "s": 9.22,
   "e": 10.38,
   "line": 4,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Guesses how?",
   "s": 10.44,
   "e": 11.3,
   "line": 5,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "First clue: where your thumb landed.",
   "s": 11.36,
   "e": 13.5,
   "line": 6,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "That much it knows.",
   "s": 13.56,
   "e": 14.62,
   "line": 6,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "What's the other clue?",
   "s": 14.68,
   "e": 15.76,
   "line": 7,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "The words before it.",
   "s": 15.82,
   "e": 17.15,
   "line": 8,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "You'd just typed \"pudding.\"",
   "s": 17.22,
   "e": 18.72,
   "line": 8,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Okay. That's fair.",
   "s": 18.78,
   "e": 20.12,
   "line": 9,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then it scores every",
   "s": 20.18,
   "e": 21.14,
   "line": 10,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "word it knows.",
   "s": 21.2,
   "e": 22.27,
   "line": 10,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Thumb spot,",
   "s": 22.54,
   "e": 23.31,
   "line": 10,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "word before,",
   "s": 23.52,
   "e": 24.47,
   "line": 10,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "how common.",
   "s": 24.64,
   "e": 25.53,
   "line": 10,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Top score wins.",
   "s": 25.76,
   "e": 26.92,
   "line": 10,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Every word?",
   "s": 26.98,
   "e": 28.01,
   "line": 11,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "How many?",
   "s": 28.08,
   "e": 28.44,
   "line": 11,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Thousands. In a blink.",
   "s": 28.5,
   "e": 30.4,
   "line": 12,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "So how does it know me?",
   "s": 30.46,
   "e": 31.6,
   "line": 13,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "You teach it.",
   "s": 31.66,
   "e": 32.67,
   "line": 14,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "A word you keep goes",
   "s": 32.78,
   "e": 34.02,
   "line": 14,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "in your own list.",
   "s": 34.08,
   "e": 35.32,
   "line": 14,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "And if I undo a fix?",
   "s": 35.38,
   "e": 36.66,
   "line": 15,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then it learns it was wrong.",
   "s": 36.72,
   "e": 38.23,
   "line": 16,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Do that enough,",
   "s": 38.56,
   "e": 39.12,
   "line": 16,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "and it stops.",
   "s": 39.18,
   "e": 40.61,
   "line": 16,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "So why does it still",
   "s": 41.22,
   "e": 42,
   "line": 17,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "turn Moe into \"more\"?",
   "s": 42.06,
   "e": 44.09,
   "line": 17,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Everyone types \"more.\" Almost",
   "s": 45.14,
   "e": 47.26,
   "line": 18,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "nobody types Moe.",
   "s": 47.32,
   "e": 49.02,
   "line": 18,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Nothing personal.",
   "s": 49.08,
   "e": 50.07,
   "line": 18,
   "sp": "A"
  }
 ],
